"original value is only offered for restoring while the current value still "
"equals this one."
msgstr ""

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:410
msgid "Order of the applications view"
msgstr ""

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:411
msgid ""
"\"custom\": the arrangement made by the user (GNOME's own app-picker-layout "
"and folder lists). \"alphabetical\": applications and folders by display "
"name in the user's language, and the applications inside each folder too; "
"rearranging by dragging is turned off. Kept up to date by the app-grid "
"extension."
msgstr ""

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:415
msgid "Arrangement saved before sorting alphabetically"
msgstr ""

#: data/schemas/io.github.deskence.Deskence.gschema.xml:416
msgid ""
"JSON written when sort-mode changes to \"alphabetical\": the previous "
"org.gnome.shell app-picker-layout (GVariant text) and the application list "
"of each folder. It is restored when sort-mode goes back to \"custom\". "
"Internal; not part of presets."
msgstr ""

